0..75 Comment "//! `copy` moves its input to its output over `Io.Eff`, and names no model."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..158 Comment "//! A pass reads the file 0 into the buffer, then writes the bytes of the read"
159..235 Comment "//! from the buffer to the file 1. Each pass reads into the same buffer that"
236..314 Comment "//! the program holds, and the buffer that comes back with a completion is the"
315..391 Comment "//! bytes of that pass alone. A read of no byte is the end of the input, and"
392..467 Comment "//! the copy ends there. The scope that handles `Io.Eff` chooses the model."
468..471 Comment "//!"
472..551 Comment "//! The copy recurses on a bound of passes, and it ends at the end of the input"
552..627 Comment "//! or of the bound. A loop that runs until the input ends has `Partial` in"
628..703 Comment "//! its row, and a model whose operation binds a value cannot handle such a"
704..766 Comment "//! subject: its continuation is a function with no `Partial`."
767..770 Comment "//!"
771..846 Comment "//! Under `Scripted`, the input is a tape in the source. Each run gives the"
847..915 Comment "//! tape after it: no input left, and the output equal to the input."
916..919 Comment "//!"
920..994 Comment "//! - see: #7844 — the first program, and the mode as a parameter of the"
995..1008 Comment "//!   program"
1009..1083 Comment "//! - see: `../../../library/std/src/io.gandr` — `Io.Eff` and `Scripted`"
